Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为女人可以做任何事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think women can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 即使她们有能力去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, just because they can,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不代表着她们应该做 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean they should, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想一下女人修车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about women fixing cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,开计程车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}driving a taxi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,砌墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}installing some drywall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有何不可呢 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的女孩子 你不会想干这些事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl like you, you don't really want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像我这样的女孩子 - 嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A girl like me? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我会对一切事敞开大门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I want all my options available.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就可以选择自己的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can decide for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 独立小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Miss Independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是我 - 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's me. - I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过你现在坐在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you're sitting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃着我的食物 看我的景色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}eating my food, enjoying my view.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择你陪着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, I chose you to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我选择引起你的注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose to make you notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的选择 萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not your choice, Sabina.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是上帝给你的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is God's gift to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不觉得收到礼物之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you think it's sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么处理才是重要的事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you do with those gifts that really matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人 女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men, women.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想充分发挥自己的潜能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all just wanna fulfill our potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,随心所欲地生活而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}live our heart's desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我想要的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the kind of world I wanna live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活呢 是百万傍身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my world is me making millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在侧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我擅长的事情太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I'm so good at so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是吗 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就很大程度地利用了女人的优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's actually considered a huge advantage to be a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 如果你很漂亮的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if you're beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人对你就不会有其他要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing else is really expected of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你不好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're not,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那基本上就没什么存在感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're pretty much rendered invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们这一行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in my line of work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没存在感 不被期待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}invisibility, low expectations…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可都是优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they come in very handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像家庭主妇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Housewife, sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,做家庭主妇没什么不好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing wrong with being a housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过那不是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会讲葡萄牙语 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't speak Portuguese. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知不知道 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you know… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人需要多花7秒钟的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it takes men an additional seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能察觉到一个女人对他有威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to perceive a woman as a threat compared to a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺激吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 谁 我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个诱饵 蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just the decoy, stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少人 - 九个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你偷女人小孩和难民的救济金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole aid money from women and children and refugees!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫盗用公款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called embezzlement!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗用公款 这词真高级啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Embezzlement"? That's fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你肯定就是会计了 - 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must be the accountant. - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开保险箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你右滑了对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, baby, you swiped right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是你女朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your girlfriend now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,底层所有东西的都装 开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything on the bottom row. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是干这行的料 我建议你转行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not cut out for this. I recommend a new line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosley!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 天使们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况看起来不错啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all this looks very promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常出色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但澳洲乔尼在哪儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about Australian Jonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗒哒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定会后悔的 - 行吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you're gonna regret this. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来打算给你整个世界的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna give you the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 你话太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, is you just talk way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你超级粘人 又那么猴急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're super clingy and come on way too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the most incredible woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最与众不同的女人 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've ever met. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是耗时四个月的侦查 跨两国的追踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's four months' surveillance, two countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我这辈子经历过最尴尬的约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the most embarrassing date I have ever been on in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题了吧 - 我会把他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we good? - I will address this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有在场的这些新朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the U.S. Justice Department,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起交给美国司法部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with, uh, all your new friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以走了 - 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're good to go. - Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我得赶紧离开这儿 休一个星期的假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of here, man. I'm gonna take a week off,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去泰国沙滩狂欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}party my ass off on a Thai beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 你也该试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you should give it a shot:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去海边 找个人娱乐一下你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}beaches, letting someone play with your, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有自己的娱乐方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have fun in my own ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上在家擦剑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sharpen your samurai swords at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是扮演猫女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cosplay Catwoman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是真的愿意买票观赏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd actually pay to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上偶尔吃点麸质你就会觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally eat gluten at night and feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就挺娱乐的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚见到的是天使们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in the presence of Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 乔尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the question is, Jonny…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 英格丽德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ingrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了 弗莱明先生在等你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are late. Mr. Fleming is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是9点开会吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wasn't the meeting set for 9?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 会议是在9点开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, 9 a.M. Is when the meeting starts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就是9点了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is exactly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟布洛克先生相处过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever spent time with him? Mr. Brok?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:06:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他邀请过我去过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had me over to his chateau,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他法国的庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坐在那儿 然后我问他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were sitting there, and I'm asking him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 布洛克先生 你听说过汉弗莱·戴维吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Mr. Brok, have you ever heard of Humphry Davy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he says, "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 那你听说过约瑟夫·斯旺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say, "Have you ever heard of Joseph Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是亚历山大·洛迪金吗 没听过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Alexander Lodygin?" "No clue."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我说 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I say, "Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那托马斯·爱迪生呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what about Thomas Edison?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 谁不知道呢 他发明了灯泡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well, of course. Who hasn't? He invented the light bulb."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 但你猜怎么着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? But guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外三个人也发明了灯泡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did those other three guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在爱迪生之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Edison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但爱迪生是第一个将灯泡推向市场的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Edison was first to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see my point?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个将要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a product that will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在能源行业掀起革命的产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}revolutionize the power industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们必须是首个将它推向市场的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to be first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么告诉布洛克先生的 他也同意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what I told Mr. Brok, and he agrees with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 埃琳娜 谢谢你过来一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - Elena, thank you for coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你聊得很开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love how this conversation went.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确来说 我什么话都还没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, I haven't said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不要在谁说了什么这个问题上纠结了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not get caught in a game of who said what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱明先生 我知道克里斯托有多重要 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fleming, I know how important Calisto is, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:08:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是主程序设计师 它就是我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the lead programmer on it. It's my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 但我在报告中写了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - But as I wrote in my report,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它的谐波范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now there is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能会颠倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the harmonic range to be reversed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道那会有多危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know how dangerous that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, you don't know what I know. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道胡里奥 那个二级工程师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you know Julio? The second engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因为脑中风现在还在住院中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's actually still in hospital after a brain seizure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅就因为在一次测试中暴露了而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was only partially exposed during a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是推测 是推测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allegedly. Allegedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡里奥是个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Julio was an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想要根权限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need is root access.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和永久修复区块链瑕疵的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and time to permanently fix the flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间而已 让它稳定安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the blockchain so it will stay safe…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,英格丽德 帮我倒杯卡布奇诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ingrid, can I get a cappuccino?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我看了你的报告了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I read your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也让其他领导看过你的报告了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had others read your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是不同意你的要求而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just simply disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克先生看过我的报告了吗 我想如果他看过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Mr. Brok read my report? I think that if he read…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把话说清楚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be crystal clear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经开发了克里斯托五年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have developed Calisto for five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要把它推向市场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are going to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是安全的 完善的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is safe and it is ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会这样汇报给布洛克先生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what we're telling Mr. Brok.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.23,0:08:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不准跟布洛克先生说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are telling Mr. Brok nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 埃琳娜 你是个聪明人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Elena, you're much too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,该知道适可而止的 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep pushing this forward, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道汉弗莱·戴维是谁 - 那你很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew who Humphry Davy was. - Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你东西掉了 - 噢 不 这不是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You dropped something. - Oh, no. That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不乱扔杂物的 所以肯定是你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't litter, so it must be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会需要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利 001号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosley, 001.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个怪老头 你真以为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You old codger. You really thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让你这样静悄悄地离开吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were gonna let you just sneak away quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.33,0:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你好 - 早上好 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Bonjour. - Buenos días, se?or.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 大家都在呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Buenos días. - Gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要祝你退休快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all wanted to wish you a happy retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有你 先生 - 波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you, sir. - Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosley. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 你的辉煌事迹太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! - You've had one hell of a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得大肆庆祝一番{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It deserves to be celebrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至还做了一个回忆片段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even put together a little walk down memory lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起看看吧 - 别 别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we? Ha, ha! - Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始喽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,校草啊 哈哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚从牛津毕业时的样子 - 帅啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fresh-faced Oxford graduate. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 这照片我找了很久呢 瞧瞧这照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Lord. - I dug deep for this. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是本色出演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你那些年过得很开心啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You clearly had a lot of fun over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 那些日子很美好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, life was good in those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那套西装你从哪儿找来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙特卡洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monte Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真给我找到了 那就是证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really happened. There's the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.31,0:11:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你开设了欧洲分部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you opened the European offices,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤森德事务所便进入国际化时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you took the Townsend Agency international.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 就没有今天的我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us would be here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 特别是我 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Especially me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常感动 谢谢你 谢谢你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm very touched. Thank you. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,说两句吧 快 致词 波士利 致词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say a few words. Come on, speech, Bosley. Speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别了吧 - 致词 致词 致词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - Speech, speech, speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,致词 致词 致词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech, speech, speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我真的受宠若惊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, frankly, I am overwhelmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grateful…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年我们共同的努力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all the work that we have done together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道的 那时查理还不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, Charlie wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:11:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以复制他在加州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we could replicate the success.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,取得的成就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he had here in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们做到了 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we made it work… - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个世界还没准备好接受天使的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a world that was really not ready for the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整40年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我招聘她们 训练她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recruited them, I trained them…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以她们为骄傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm so very proud of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosleys…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要保护她们的安全 - 会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you keep them safe. - Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 收到 - 我们会的 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hear, hear. - We will, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 就像查理说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so for me, as Charlie said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候华丽退场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}time to make an exit stage left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 说到查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha… Ah, speaking of Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你身处的这个房间 老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look around this room, old friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼前的这些男士女士们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll see the men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会带着你的成就继续辉煌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who will carry your legacy into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的领导精神和奉献精神是无与伦比的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your leadership and commitment is unparalleled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给予我们的 是我们还不清的恩情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you a debt we cannot repay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我们给你准备了块手表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So instead, we got you a watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手表 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A watch? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,退休快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你应得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很喜欢开派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really like to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样白天才能喝酒嘛 这才是我的心头好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the day drinking. That's what I like the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不赖嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敬波士利 - 敬大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To Bosley! - To all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说的就是我所唱的 我觉得这很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This speech is my recital I think it's very vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇滚的秘诀就在于踩点正确 但这很难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To rock a rhyme, that's right On time, "It's Tricky" Is…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 就这样 你赶紧走吧 他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. That's it. Please move. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.51,0:13:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 准备好了吗 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For sure. - Are we ready? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说唱很溜啊 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a sick flow, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说了 - 你还真唱啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shut up, shut up. - You really went for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有两个位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two seats over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很难 - 太难了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's tricky. - Tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太难了 - 太太难了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tricky. - Tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯顿 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langston, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌声有请我们的创始人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, please help me welcome our founder,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的投资方 亚历山大·布洛克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our benefactor, Alexander Brok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克先生 您定下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brok, you have set.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,创新的最高标准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the highest standards for innovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 我 在团队的小小帮助下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that I, along with a little help from my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经完成了挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have met that challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 在我带领下 汉堡能源公司将{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, I instructed the Hamburg power utility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这栋建筑从电网中独立开来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to disconnect this building from the electrical grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们完全不会没电可用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are far from powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brok,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您授予根权限 可以吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you grant us root access?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 亚历山大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Alexander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,根权限确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root access granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托 开灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto, turn on the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托 匹配姐妹装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto, pair with sister devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托 电力全开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto, full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克工业供电全球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brok Industries can power the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最终是采用了稀土磁性材料吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you went with rare-earth magnetics in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在氰化物水晶矩阵里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside a cyanide crystal matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是蓝晶石 但是 - 蓝晶石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's kyanite, but… - Kyanite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以试试吗 - 请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, may I? - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有遵照安全行为准则的要求吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You delivered on the safety protocols?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 克里斯托只能联通电路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, absolutely. Calisto only talks with electrical circuitry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的电流不会对人类 宠物 植物造成伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The current never touches people, pets, plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是智能的 安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's smart, and it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 要全面发售的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, uh, in the spirit of full disclosure,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说它有一个小问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should mention one small thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,针对女性客户 我们可以将它定制成各种颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be manufactured in pastel colors for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以为所有人提供清洁能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can bring clean energy to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不消竭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sustainably.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托就是未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto is the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于将未来握于手中了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am holding the future in my hands, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们来庆祝吧 吧台有酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's celebrate. Drinks in the bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持姿势 格挡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your form. Block.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我解开 绑紧一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take this one off. Make it tighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎还不错 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris is not so bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你租了那个光线充足的公寓了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take the apartment with the good light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但你要是送我植物的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But if you get me a plant…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会直接把它弄死的 - 当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just gonna kill it. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}D'accord, d'accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好接新任务了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready for a new assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我已经约了一个新客户见面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've set a meeting with a new client.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个企业吹哨人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A corporate whistle-blower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正要组一个团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting a team together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个团队 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A… A team? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要见我 是吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanted to see me, right? - Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是前军情六处忍者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the former MI6 ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼（六月）吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it June?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 简 简 不是六月哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jane. Jane. Not the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是萨布里娜吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabrina?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 是个意大利名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina. It's Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是意大利人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, are you Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我 可能是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I… Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在汉堡有个新案子 是个新客户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a situation in Hamburg, a new client.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉堡 有意思 汉堡不是汉堡的发明地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hamburg. Interestingly, not where hamburgers were invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉堡的发明地是法兰克福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was in Frankfurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但法兰克福熏肠也不是法兰克福人发明的 这很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where frankfurters were not invented, which…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不觉得这是 - 不好意思 我吃素的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think that this is… - I'm sorry. I'm vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你 但是我记得我听说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much. But I recall hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩在里约合作得很愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two worked well together in Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得她把我从屋顶上推下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recall her pushing me off a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得那时刚好是撤退时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recall it was time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵 难怪啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,客户是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the client?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃琳娜 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elena? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是波士利先生吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Mr. Bosley?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫我波士利就好 - 谢谢你来见我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just Bosley. - Thank you for seeing me. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您要点些什么吗 - 请给我浓缩咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like anything? - Uh, espresso, bitte.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merci, ?a va.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.97,0:18:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,浓缩咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Espresso.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,COS附近情况确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}COS perimeter check.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,COS{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cos"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have less than no idea what that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是从这上面看 你是安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are good up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近无威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事我考虑了很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have thought about this a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是把它交给布洛克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is get it to Mr. Brok.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经试着联系他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have tried to contact him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,踏出这一步是非常艰难的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it takes a lot to come forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很佩服你的勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I appreciate your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你要冒这个险吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you wanna take this risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们可以帮助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况有点失控了 - 别叫了 你太可爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just getting out of hand. - Stop it, you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要养条狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经让我夜不成眠了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明知情 却什么也不能说 什么也不能做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing and not being allowed to do or say anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以修好它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要一个机会而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I just need the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 你可以拿到证据吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you. Were you able to get the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我所有的报告和研究数据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my reports, all my data.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,您要点些什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I bring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的小票 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your check, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是信号吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that the signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃琳娜 - 出什么事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elena… - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去趟洗手间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go to the ladies' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不用 谢谢 - 动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm fine. Thank you. - Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 出什么事了 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's happening? Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello… Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Shit, shit, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开车 - 开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 带客户走 我刚刚就想说这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Evac the client! That's what I was gonna say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 你不是服务员吗 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. You're not a waitress? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是简 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jane. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你带了大家伙了吗 - 在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you bring the big gun? - In the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻烦你挪下脚好吗 - 好 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you move your feet? - Oh, sure. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, do you know how to use that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 他在朝我们开枪吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Is he shooting at us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.70,0:22:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了 女士们 - 啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, ladies. - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是坦克吗 我的天 他去哪了 他去哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a tank? Oh, my God. Where'd he go? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我们甩掉他了 - 对付这女孩需要这么大手笔吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we lost him! - Bit much for just this girl, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小妞是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.05,0:22:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.15,0:22:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 他又是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?! Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他朝我们开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is he shooting at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,车开稳一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 我死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.03,0:22:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧槽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.87,0:23:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merde!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 快趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low. Stay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我信号急转弯 - 准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do a J-turn on my mark. - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.61,0:25:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.78,0:25:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我说躺着别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I said, stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.96,0:26:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃三明治吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,三文鱼的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.59,0:26:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有可能是芝士的 不过不太好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless it's cheese, and it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.57,0:26:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你饿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you? You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.26,0:26:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理向你们慰问 天使们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie sends love, Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.97,0:26:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁 她是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she? Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.40,0:26:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 她被吓到了 而且全身都是呕吐物的味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, she's in shock, and she smells like puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.17,0:26:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.31,0:26:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是波士利 - 波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Bosley. - Bosley?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.78,0:26:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利是我们组织里的职称{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosley's a rank in our organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.01,0:26:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是中尉一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见的那个男人叫埃德加·德桑齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real name of the man you met was Edgar Dessange.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.25,0:27:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.92,0:27:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 节哀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道他对你意义深重 - 噢 我不需要你的拥抱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know how much he meant to you. - Oh, I don't need a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.90,0:27:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱总是有用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hugs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们去休整一下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get you cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.62,0:27:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.15,0:27:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆车是偷来的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a stolen car?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.85,0:27:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.16,0:27:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利342 开启6号安全屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosley, 342. Open Safe House 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.80,0:27:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士 还有谁知道我们要在汉堡和埃琳娜见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz, who else knew we were meeting with Elena in Hamburg?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.67,0:27:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,按规定来说 没人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, protocol would be not to tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这样问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.07,0:27:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bosley…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德加认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.15,0:28:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你没有亲眼见到这个家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you didn't see this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是职业杀手 为了这个一个小鱼小虾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a pro, and he brought quite a lot of firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要带这么些火力威猛的武器吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for such an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.65,0:28:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 他戏超多的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was so extra, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要抓这个妹子 我一个苍蝇拍就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could take that girl out with a flyswatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.59,0:28:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竟然开了一辆超大型的武装机车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He rocks up in this urban assault vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.99,0:28:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们猜测他是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're thinking what? He was…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她是被监视的对象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she was being watched…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.53,0:28:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果是我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what if we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.00,0:28:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁会监视我们 - 嘿 我洗好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And by who? - Hey, you guys. All cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.74,0:28:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉好点了吗 - 嗯 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feeling better? - Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.81,0:28:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在好像开始懂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of getting this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该是女间谍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are like lady spies and…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.24,0:28:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道这个人是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to explain who this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有为什么他要追杀你们 - 噢 是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and why was he shooting at you. - Oh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是在追杀你 - 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was shooting at you. - Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.09,0:28:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,追杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.96,0:28:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.63,0:28:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 喝点茶吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Just have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个杀手就是个幽灵 面部识别系统近几年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shooter's a ghost. Facial recognition's popped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.53,0:28:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在几个地方发现过他的踪迹 但是除此之外 没有名字 也没有任何记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a few places over the years but no name, no record, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.80,0:28:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明他肯定是有背景的咯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got friends in high places then huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.60,0:28:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了他 - 我可得提醒你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna kill him. - I'm obliged to remind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.61,0:29:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理最不喜欢复仇了 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie frowns on revenge, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.71,0:29:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 霍夫林小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ms. Houghlin,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.94,0:29:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的资料显示 你是卡利斯托项目的系统工程师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your file says you are a systems engineer on the Calisto project.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.05,0:29:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 你竟然知道卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know about Calisto?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道很多事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know about a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.35,0:29:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你是麻省理工的优秀毕业生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you graduated top of your class at MIT,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你周日会去学马伽术 你骑车去上班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you take Krav Maga on Sunday, you ride your bike to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.26,0:29:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你穿黄色好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think yellow is one of your colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.12,0:29:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们都知道 黄色谁穿都难看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when, in fact, it's no one's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.36,0:29:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还知道 如果你的约会网站头像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you could be dating more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.29,0:29:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,能突出一下你的颧骨 你可能会有更多的约会机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you played up the cheekbones in your online profile pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.53,0:29:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不知道的是 为什么有人要你死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we don't know is why someone wants you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我能修好它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it can be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.47,0:29:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一步步慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take this one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.14,0:29:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统里有个漏洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a flaw in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.27,0:29:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个漏洞是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the flaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.91,0:29:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利斯托可以被武器化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto can be weaponized.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.91,0:29:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我能修好这个漏洞 但是现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can fix it. But right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.95,0:29:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何感兴趣或是想犯罪的 有点能力的黑客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any decent hacker, curious or criminal enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都能把卡利斯托变成人体电磁脉冲装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could turn Calisto into an EMP on the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.79,0:29:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种电磁脉冲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An electromagnetic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上就是脑梗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brain seizure, essentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.92,0:29:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 看到没 我不是花瓶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - See? I know stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.96,0:29:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会扰动神经系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It disrupts the neural networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.80,0:29:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来就像是中风 或是动脉瘤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and looks like a stroke or an aneurysm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.86,0:30:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以使用者的踪迹是完全无法追查的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it can be used without a trace of evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.33,0:30:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个完美的暗杀机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect assassination machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.44,0:30:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 利用我所创造的网络系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And it can be triggered remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.67,0:30:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还能远程狙击目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the network that I created.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.71,0:30:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷啊 看吧 如果上课好好听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dope. See, that is what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.48,0:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就能发明这种东西 - 还有谁知道这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if you pay attention in school. - Who else knows about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.11,0:30:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我发现我的同事差点死了的时候 我就在安全检查时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I filed a report after it almost killed my colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,上报了 但是我觉得它应该被掩盖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}during a security test, but I think it was buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.85,0:30:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是我的报告 不是我的同事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My report, not my colleague. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.85,0:30:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡里奥没事 他 额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julio is fine. He, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.69,0:30:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是再也没办法说话 也看不见颜色罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just can't speak or see color anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.86,0:30:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西还没量产吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in production yet is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.49,0:30:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们没有按计划完工 但是我们现在有六个原型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're behind schedule, but there are six prototypes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.76,0:30:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在布洛克仓库 还有一个在我的实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Brok facility vault, plus the one at my lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想用那个来修好设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was using to program to fix, which…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.37,0:30:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把那些原型机弄出来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get those prototypes out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.34,0:30:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 不好意思 能暂停一下吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm sorry. Can we just hit pause for a second, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.77,0:30:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们公司有没有带有你们员工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your company have a website.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.34,0:30:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,头像的网站呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an employee directory with photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.28,0:30:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 但是布洛克工业的安全级别是地狱级的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but Brok Industries is equipped with insane security.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不可能 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no way… - There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.85,0:30:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她的卡还能进去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think she still has security clearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.15,0:30:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果进不去的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she doesn't, we'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.62,0:30:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能知道威胁来自公司内部 所以不管怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the threat comes from within, so either way…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.85,0:30:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都会拿到我们要的信息 - 不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We get the information we need. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:30:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.06,0:31:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 - 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. - I…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.60,0:31:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Hm…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.26,0:31:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 锅盖头 - 锅盖头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bowl cuts. - Bowl cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.10,0:31:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,锅盖头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowl cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.51,0:31:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就锅盖头了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowl cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.05,0:31:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.82,0:31:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉夫 我只是想进去工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to get to work, Ralph.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 我也得做好我的工作啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I gotta do my job too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.70,0:31:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.37,0:31:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新发型哈 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New look, huh? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.07,0:31:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.74,0:31:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉夫 你这样会耽误别人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you holding people up, Ralph?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.41,0:31:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你今天开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have yourself a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了要微笑噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't… Don't forget to smile, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.92,0:32:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么 你们怎么进来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How… How did you even get in the…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.82,0:32:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你对普拉迪普做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. What did you do to Pradeep?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,普拉迪普·普拉萨德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pradeep Prasad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 普拉迪普没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Pradeep's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天早上在健身房偷了他的证件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I nabbed his ID card from the gym this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.40,0:32:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.23,0:32:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.17,0:32:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.31,0:32:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那斯万呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.21,0:32:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我压住了他的颈动脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I compressed his carotid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.71,0:32:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他的脑部缺氧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deoxygenated his brain stem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.88,0:33:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很痛啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that sounds painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.85,0:33:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 更像是打了个瞌睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's like taking a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.48,0:33:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻见一股焦面包味 然后眼前一黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell burnt toast, then everything goes dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.52,0:33:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他会醒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't worry, he's gonna wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.52,0:33:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不一定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh, unless he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.22,0:33:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What… - We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.03,0:33:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们下次巡逻 我们还在这栋楼里面的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're in the building when they do their next security sweep,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.49,0:33:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全得进德国监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going to German prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.00,0:33:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们每天都得吃炸猪排了 每天噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm, and then it's schnitzel. All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.06,0:33:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来也不赖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not such a bad deal, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.63,0:33:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 你从去保险库里找卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina, you get Calisto from the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.77,0:33:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 你去拿你实验室里的原型机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, you get the prototype from your lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.94,0:33:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去引开守卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep security distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.64,0:33:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.17,0:33:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 击掌一下 妹子合心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. High five. Girl power.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.02,0:33:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.29,0:33:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次别吐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No puking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.19,0:34:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一堆巴哥的破机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buggy piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.57,0:34:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa… No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.28,0:34:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波士 你在吗 - 在呢 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boz, you with us? - I'm here. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.45,0:34:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利斯托不见了 不在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto's gone. It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.55,0:34:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人先偷走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone beat us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.92,0:34:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情更有趣了哈 你知道是谁吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plot thickens. Can you get an ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到了 一个叫皮特·弗莱明的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Some guy. Peter Fleming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.26,0:34:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等等看埃琳娜那边有什么收获{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what Elena comes back with.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.30,0:35:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们可能有另一个麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. We might have another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.57,0:35:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个普拉迪普出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy Pradeep just showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.97,0:35:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,普拉迪普没去做单车操吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pradeep didn't spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.57,0:35:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他都买好优惠劵了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he signed up for the Groupon and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.94,0:35:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在楼下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.85,0:35:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉夫 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ralph? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.98,0:35:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,普拉迪普·普拉萨德在前台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got Pradeep Prasad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是系统里显示他已经进了大楼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system says he's in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.32,0:35:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 系统出了点小问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there's a glitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.79,0:35:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是这部电脑以为埃琳娜·霍夫林是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the computer thinks Elena Houghlin is…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.76,0:35:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在埃琳娜·霍夫林的照片发给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, I'm sending you an image of Elena Houghlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.63,0:35:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发给所有人 抓住她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it to all our guys. I want her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.33,0:35:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拘留审问 - 收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- detained for questioning. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.79,0:35:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在实验室里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in her lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.16,0:35:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.07,0:36:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫队来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here comes the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.14,0:36:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在集中人手 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heat is assembling, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 他们知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.51,0:36:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们撤离点见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, meet me at the pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.75,0:36:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 我这边很难搞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina? This one's real hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.88,0:36:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你引开别人的注意力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to exhibit some attention-seeking behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.82,0:36:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have so many ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.89,0:36:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍夫林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houghlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.90,0:36:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.20,0:36:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.83,0:36:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 等等 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait, wait. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.54,0:36:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到她了 - 哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I got her. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.00,0:36:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.31,0:36:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.91,0:36:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 她在十一楼 十一楼 女洗手间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, she's on 11. Level 11, women's restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.09,0:37:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 额 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Uh, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.89,0:37:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 坐好 把手放在我能看到的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Sit down. Keep hands where I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是安全检疫部门的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with Health and Safety?
