Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.71,0:45:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,肋骨错位 很常见的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Displaced rib. Very common.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.48,0:45:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还需要其他调整 我随时为你服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever need additional adjustments, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.55,0:45:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣人专门照顾我们的健康和饮食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saint takes care of our health and well-being.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.05,0:45:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我们随时有精力战斗 - 额 我尽力而为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keeps us in fighting shape - Yeah. Well, I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.69,0:45:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他滋养我们的大脑 身体 和灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He feeds our mind, body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.22,0:46:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我们应该花点时间悼念一下埃德加吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, should we take a moment to remember Edgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.26,0:46:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备了晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prepared a mini feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.93,0:46:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来纪念我们美好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to honor our beautiful friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.13,0:46:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有黑色羊乳干酪 帕尔玛奶酪 曼彻格芝士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Pecorino Nero, Parmigiano-Reggiano, Manchego,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.07,0:46:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有 最重要的 - 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and, of course… - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.74,0:46:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他最喜欢布里干酪了 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He loved Brie. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.24,0:46:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 还有红酒 - 特别是红酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah! And wine. - Especially wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.71,0:46:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我还以为你们会吃什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, I thought you guys were gonna serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.78,0:46:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆芽 或是小麦草之类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, bean sprouts and wheatgrass.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.58,0:46:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓饮食就是你在食物中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating is all about the intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.85,0:46:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾注的意念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you put into your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.12,0:46:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你尊重那头牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you honor the cow,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.49,0:46:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它产出来的奶酪 一定对你的身体好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cheese is gonna be good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.99,0:46:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我知道现在这个情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I understand the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.09,0:46:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定很有压力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that brought you here have been stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.16,0:46:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超级有压力 - 如果你需要聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So stressful. - If you ever need to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.93,0:46:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个执业心理治疗师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a licensed psychotherapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.46,0:46:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我总算知道你们为什么叫他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I can really see why you guys call him…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.37,0:46:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣人了 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Saint. - Yes. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.30,0:46:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 我这里还有电解质水 - 好呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, electrolyte-enhanced water? - Mm, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.34,0:46:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有 吃一片这个 对你的口气有帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and also try this. It's really good for your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.71,0:46:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 谢了 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, thank you. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.25,0:47:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把最后一个进保险库里的人的证件号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent the ID of the last person to access the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.95,0:47:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,录入系统里了 调取了汉堡所有的监控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}through our search system, ran every CCTV.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,和安保摄像头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and security cam in Hamburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.32,0:47:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱明 那是我 那是那个掩盖我报告的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleming. That's my… That's the guy that buried my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.43,0:47:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 看 这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hm. - Look. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.83,0:47:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他五分钟前在机场里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was at the airport five hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.27,0:47:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以他离开了德国 - 带着箱子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So he's left Germany. - With the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.33,0:47:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道卡利斯托有什么威力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows exactly what Calisto can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.30,0:47:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道在黑市里这东西能卖多少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what it's worth on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.51,0:47:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在卖这个东西 他肯定想要灭了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's selling it, he'd want you out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.94,0:47:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在扩展调查范围 - 不好意思打断一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm broadening the search. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.74,0:47:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是弗莱明想杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleming tried to have me killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.34,0:47:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能 也有可能是买家的指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Maybe at the direction of a buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.35,0:47:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人不喜欢事情出纰漏 这个新玩意是你设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad guys don't like loose ends, you made a fancy new toy…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.25,0:47:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我是他的下属啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I worked for him. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.42,0:47:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还跟我调过情呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he flirted with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.72,0:47:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.32,0:47:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人可以边爱你 边要你死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man can love you and want you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.39,0:47:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 我可不是这种人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.33,0:47:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我婚礼上还发生枪战了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a gunfight at my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.16,0:47:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你结婚了 - 没有 我抢手着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, you're married? - No. I was the better shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.67,0:47:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我想吃奶酪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I need cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶酪 那是什么东西的代号吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cheese." Is that a code for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.10,0:47:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 它代指的是 我已经四十岁了 还单身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's code for "I'm 40 and single,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.91,0:47:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我内心有个奶酪那么大的空缺急需填补{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have a cheese-size hole in my soul to fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.98,0:48:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你内心的空缺准备了素食冰淇淋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also have vegan ice cream for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.18,0:48:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真懂我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really know what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.82,0:48:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该绕过弗莱明 越级上报的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have just gone around Fleming.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.68,0:48:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是循规蹈矩 遵守层及规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not followed some stupid chain of command.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.22,0:48:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该直接去找布洛克 我还是太傻太天真啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone directly to Brok. But, no, I just rolled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.22,0:48:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably the last people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.83,0:48:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么感觉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would know what that feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.66,0:48:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小到大都有被抛弃情结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up with major abandonment issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.20,0:48:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此做了不少缺心眼的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It led to some pretty self-sabotaging behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.53,0:48:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得我被送到了好几家少管所里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which landed me in various institutional facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.87,0:48:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理把我保了出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie bailed me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.57,0:48:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是查理的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it wasn't for Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.21,0:48:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能就已经死了 或是回到监狱里 所以 我懂你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd probably be dead or back in prison, so I feel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.61,0:48:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我基本上是在无助和悔恨的边缘长大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pretty much grew up on the corner of powerless and ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.38,0:48:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不是住在派克大街吗 你是富二代吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You grew up on Park Avenue. Aren't you an heiress?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.79,0:48:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,富人有富人的烦恼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More money, more problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.82,0:48:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 查理怎么找到你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about you? How did Charlie find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.59,0:48:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,简以前是军情六处最年轻的特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane is former MI6. Youngest recruit ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.76,0:48:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为英国情报组织效力吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked for British intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.56,0:48:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是曾经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said "Former."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.63,0:48:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾循规蹈矩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also followed the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.50,0:48:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,层级规则也不适合我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chain of command didn't work out so well for me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.27,0:49:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉夫死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ralph's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.14,0:49:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了拉夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Ralph.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.07,0:49:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我是个杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.38,0:49:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.71,0:49:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,附带伤害而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.25,0:49:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会把这笔账记在你身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't take that on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.95,0:49:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在问题是 如果卡利斯托落到坏人手上的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, if Calisto falls in the wrong hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.59,0:49:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们得在它伤害更多人之前把它抢回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we have to get it back before it hurts more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.32,0:49:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.43,0:49:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱明先生刚刚在伊斯坦布尔入境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fleming just cleared passport control in Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.46,0:49:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.93,0:49:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟伊斯坦布尔有什么过节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your problem with Istanbul?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.90,0:49:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃了隔夜的没有煮熟的羊肉和酸奶汁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got food poisoning from undercooked lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.97,0:49:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物中毒了 然后我又饿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yogurt sauce I left out, but then I got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢 - 肯定是和你不一样的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.54,0:49:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失陪一会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.14,0:49:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.15,0:49:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保证那个杀手离我们远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be sure that assassin stays away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.22,0:49:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动要保密 直到我们查出所有的幕后玩家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should keep this quiet until we know who all the players are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.36,0:49:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道这个卡利斯托是什么 或是谁想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what this Calisto is or who wants it,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.86,0:49:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要谨慎行事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's play it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.33,0:49:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位拉尔夫杀手怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Ralph-killer in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.30,0:50:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去衣帽间 配上装备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the closet, gear her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.70,0:50:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人问起 就说我们去巴西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if anybody asks, we're going to Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.67,0:50:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.69,0:50:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊斯坦布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.29,0:50:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜·霍夫林怎么处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Elena Houghlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.80,0:50:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.38,0:50:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拆开看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.78,0:50:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有 没有跟踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. No tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.29,0:50:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发出任何信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not emitting any signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.52,0:50:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What had you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.23,0:51:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.03,0:51:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.53,0:51:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨子里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in the bones. Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.50,0:51:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.40,0:51:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是你太想念这份工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it's simply that you miss the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.04,0:51:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会变老的 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all get old, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.10,0:51:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,退休并不是判了死刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retirement is not a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想退休的人还好意思说我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the man who refuses to retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.95,0:51:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.52,0:51:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.26,0:51:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有东西在你的骨头里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in the bones, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.43,0:51:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会这么对你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.44,0:51:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个知道我对她起疑的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who knows I'm on to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.81,0:51:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.40,0:52:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.97,0:52:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是我梦寐以求的衣帽间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the closet of my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.24,0:52:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的可以随便拿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just get to take whatever I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.77,0:52:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是借 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Borrow. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.27,0:52:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有这个规矩么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an actual rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.14,0:52:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 所以你要从基础保护层开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So you wanna start with a protective base layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.95,0:52:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我推荐这件珠绣内衣 怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recommend a beaded camisole. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.65,0:52:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 某种高分子材料制成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Some kind of polymer material.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.35,0:52:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 防弹的 复合防弹衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, bulletproof, composite body armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.06,0:52:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它最初是作为航天器的保护层的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was originally developed as a protective layer for spacecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.36,0:52:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这款内衣可不扎胸 科技进步带给女性的福音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And it's a bra that doesn't dig. Progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.90,0:52:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备得怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.53,0:52:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 还在第一层啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, we're still in the first closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.81,0:52:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个衣帽间吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's another closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.41,0:52:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 打开军械库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm. Armory open.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.21,0:53:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 我想给你看个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.38,0:53:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 来 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Come on, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.66,0:53:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 戴这个试试 - 哦 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, try these on. - Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.49,0:53:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 这有什么功能 哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What do they do? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.73,0:53:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这眼镜功能绝了 哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they do? Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.50,0:53:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 你比我想象得要年轻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. You're younger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.90,0:53:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去生活艰辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lived hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.23,0:53:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把你麻省理工的学位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can put that MIT degree to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.24,0:53:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用在这样的东西上 - 这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with something like this? - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.14,0:53:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,通用接口 可以让你侵入几乎所有设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Universal Interface. Lets you hack into almost anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.88,0:53:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 把几乎去掉 是所有设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mm, not almost anything. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.98,0:53:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里有一个新产品 - 是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So here's the new baby. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.41,0:53:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速来复 用来发射麻醉剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}High-velocity rifle, customized to fire tranquilizer darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.38,0:53:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,非致命 反应迅速 非常之高效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nonlethal, fast-acting, very potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.79,0:53:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 你有新玩具了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you have a new cuddle buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.62,0:53:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给埃琳娜安装通讯设备吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we fit Elena with comms?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.96,0:53:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.36,0:53:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷 就是那种入耳式的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that in-ear radio thing you guys have?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.43,0:53:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比那更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.93,0:53:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一种皮下发射器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a subdermal transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.70,0:53:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过骨骼传导 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works through bone conduction. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.04,0:53:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要去纹身吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm getting a tattoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.31,0:54:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 不是 纹身是天使通过努力才能获得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. Tattoos are earned by Angels over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.11,0:54:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给你一个临时版本的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get a less permanent version.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.88,0:54:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 通讯器隐藏在手镯里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, comms are concealed in the link.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.08,0:54:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你戴上它 就可以听到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you have it on, you can hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.25,0:54:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷 嘿 我可以拿一盒薄荷糖么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Hey, can I take these mints?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.25,0:54:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 别碰这些薄荷糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Avoid the mints.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.56,0:54:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不要到处乱摸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, let's just stop the touching around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.12,0:54:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道的 有些东西会爆炸 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, some of this blows up. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.47,0:54:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方简直太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.31,0:54:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是世界的十字路口 危险和金钱的代表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the crossroads of the world. Danger and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.18,0:54:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找出弗莱明和他的买家交易的地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to figure out where Mr. Fleming's meeting his buyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.32,0:54:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,取回卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get Calisto back before it becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.19,0:54:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它成为每一个坏蛋最爱的新武器之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}every bad guy's favorite new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.59,0:54:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像行李箱核武器 - 宠物老虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like suitcase nukes. - Pet tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.62,0:54:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喷气式滑雪板 - 水上摩托艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jet Skis. - Sea-Doos.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.83,0:54:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,极速跑车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cars that go fast really furiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.66,0:54:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要怎么找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.10,0:55:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在已经脱离了事务所 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're off the agency's grid here, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么找到他 我们走上街头 用老办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we find him? We hit the streets. We go old-school.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.77,0:55:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,用钱 用拳头换消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sling some bills. We get violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.54,0:55:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己今天像只老虎 或者豹子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like a tiger today, maybe a leopard.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.68,0:55:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管怎样 我都要狂野起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But either way, I am down to get wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.08,0:55:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里我可能有联系人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have a contact here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.48,0:55:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我在军情六处时的线人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An asset from when I was with MI6.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.28,0:55:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 可能是指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, "Might" As in?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.65,0:55:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定住在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in she definitely lives here,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.28,0:55:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她恨死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she definitely hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.60,0:55:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,练习练习你的英语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practice your English?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.30,0:55:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Good morning. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.30,0:55:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糖果 - 糖果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Candy! - Candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.77,0:55:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你依然对当地的孩子这么好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still spoiling the local kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.98,0:55:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 离我远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.68,0:55:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,法蒂玛 等一下 求你了 跟我聊聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatima, wait. Please, just talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.05,0:55:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,找别人聊去吧 我不能再跟你有任何瓜葛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to someone else. I can't get involved with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.92,0:55:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,法蒂玛 拜托等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatima, please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.35,0:55:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经等过你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I waited for you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.55,0:55:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.52,0:56:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我失信了 但我已经不再为军情六处工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wasn't there for you, but I don't work for MI6 anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.26,0:56:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在为这些人工作 - 我不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I work for these people now. - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.00,0:56:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会帮你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.56,0:56:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.90,0:56:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们资金雄厚 非政府 是非政府组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are very well-funded. Non-governmental, NGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.24,0:56:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以提供让你事业运转起来的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can get whatever you need to get up and running today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.41,0:56:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有无尽的等待 也不会违背承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No waiting. No broken promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.32,0:56:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.72,0:56:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只跟你喝杯茶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.39,0:56:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.26,0:56:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个男人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.34,0:56:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.71,0:56:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know someone who has.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.64,0:56:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 我可以帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.11,0:56:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,重建诊所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebuild the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.98,0:56:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在倒是能帮我了 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can help me now? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.28,0:57:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们告诉我 我的线人很安全时 我相信了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed them when they told me my asset was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.29,0:57:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信了你 但我却失去了所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believed you, but I lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.99,0:57:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不拒绝那些我再也帮不上忙的未婚妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to turn away unwed mothers I could no longer help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.16,0:57:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.56,0:57:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我选择退出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.50,0:57:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们重建对彼此的信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me rebuild our trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.07,0:57:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了一些日常用品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.55,0:57:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.92,0:57:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.26,0:57:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以在六个月内再给你一批货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you another shipment in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.89,0:57:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.80,0:57:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那需要多久你能找到我们想要的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long will it take for your sources to find our guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.97,0:57:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we really need to…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.11,0:57:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是医生订的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what the doctor ordered?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.27,0:57:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们开始卸货吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's get this off the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.31,0:58:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.62,0:58:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.22,0:58:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的人在一个酒店 帕夏酒店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man is in a hotel. The Pasha Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.19,0:58:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,易卜拉欣·帕夏吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ibrahim Pasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.50,0:58:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁能把我们带到他的房间么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know anybody who can get us into his room?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.13,0:58:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.47,0:58:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个卡车我也要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take the van too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.04,0:58:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.35,0:58:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在帕夏 我们出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pasha. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.19,0:58:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽可能多地了解一下弗莱明的伊斯坦布尔之行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's learn all we can about Mr. Fleming's trip to Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.37,0:58:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱明出去的时候 我们进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Fleming goes out, we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.74,0:59:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,复制他的设备 收集他所有通讯信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double his devices. Gather all his communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.77,0:59:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易时间 地点 和谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The when, the where, the who.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.18,0:59:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在看哥斯达黎加的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been looking at property in Costa Rica.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.52,0:59:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一个海外银行账户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's got an offshore bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.85,0:59:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.59,0:59:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢 我该做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me? What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.83,0:59:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该已经死了 所以你就放松一下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing as you're supposed to be dead, why don't you relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.03,0:59:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱明会认出你的 我们不能冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleming could recognize you, and we can't risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.87,0:59:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢 我吃饱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. Full.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.22,0:59:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,混进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.51,1:00:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 他快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, he's almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.81,1:00:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 现在给他发短信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina, text him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.75,1:00:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你还好么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.49,1:00:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到帽子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't find my hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.12,1:00:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你找帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.73,1:00:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的帽子 - 谢谢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your hat. - Thank you. Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.66,1:00:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见我的手机了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.67,1:00:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的包 - 哦 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your bag. - Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.57,1:00:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 它在这 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, there it is. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.44,1:00:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 都在这了 我们调查了他的通讯记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty, here it is. We filtered his communications,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.28,1:00:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来弗雷明明天要在土耳其德比马赛上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it seems Mr. Fleming is selling Calisto.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.68,1:00:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把卡利斯托卖掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tomorrow at the Turkish derby.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.75,1:00:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,于华里马场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veliefendi Hippodrome.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.18,1:00:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这个特别的赛马场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, this particular racetrack.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.95,1:00:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很受富商的欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is popular with a syndicate of wealthy businessmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.49,1:00:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问这里和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt with connections.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.06,1:00:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际军火交易 毒品贩卖 还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to international arms deals, drug trade and…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.06,1:01:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有有可能对卡利斯托感兴趣的人有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All parties who might be interested in Calisto.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.56,1:01:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟记你的身份 辛迪加成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Familiarize yourselves: syndicate members,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.36,1:01:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,受邀参加的马匹富商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wealthy horse owners expected to attend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.06,1:01:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,标注弗雷明可能交易的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flag anyone Fleming could be in business with.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.33,1:01:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.14,1:01:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不只是一个吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I am not just some frightened girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.84,1:01:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要你们保护的姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your witness protection program.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.07,1:01:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们需要帮忙进出某个地方 我可以做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need help getting in and out of someplace, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.31,1:01:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以侵入任何系统 而且操作很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hack any system, and I can do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.85,1:01:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要我 波士利女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me, Mrs. Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.75,1:01:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说我不行因为我知道我可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't tell me I can't do it because I know I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.79,1:01:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我受够了一直闲着 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am… I'm done sitting still. I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.12,1:01:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体验过一次 我想要更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a taste. I want more.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.46,1:01:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.40,1:01:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经看到一个很胖的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I once saw a really fat baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.63,1:01:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一只猫碰鼻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving Eskimo kisses to a kitten.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.84,1:01:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比你可爱多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was more adorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.54,1:01:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个例子也是在暗示既然让你参加会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, it's implied that you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.58,1:01:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就表示你已经加入我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're in this briefing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.34,1:01:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给了你黑客设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she gave you the universal hacking tool.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.71,1:01:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和手镯 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the bracelet, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.15,1:01:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.05,1:02:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么感觉 看起来好像还不错的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how'd that feel? It looked like it felt really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.39,1:02:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常不错 - 我是打算等我看完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Felt nice. - I was just gonna give you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.62,1:02:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就把平板给你的 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the tablet once I was done. - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.96,1:02:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额 可以继续了 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, carry on. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.27,1:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was about to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.23,1:02:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多地方要覆盖到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a lot of ground to cover,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.87,1:02:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要分开行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're gonna need to spread out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.90,1:02:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 你就是我们的天眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, you'll be our eye in the sky.
