Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.48,1:02:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你送进去 你黑进监控系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you in. You hack into the security cameras.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.71,1:02:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视弗莱明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch for Mr. Fleming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.25,1:02:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,简负责人群控制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane's on crowd control.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.95,1:02:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,土耳其德比马赛吸引了成千上万的观众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turkish derby attracts thousands of spectators.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.36,1:02:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要进行扫描和评估{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who need to be scanned and assessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.06,1:02:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,站得高 望得远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start low, go high.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.56,1:02:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your nest,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.93,1:02:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以提供战术支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can provide tactical support.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.57,1:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除一切阻碍行动的威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out any threats to the operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.20,1:02:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 你负责地面比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina, you'll run the ground game.
