Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.98,1:02:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要一举擒获弗莱明 买家和卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Fleming, his buyer and Calisto.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.91,1:03:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.35,1:03:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来负责运输{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of the transportation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.15,1:03:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,并准备撤离计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and prep for extraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.85,1:03:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把所有人都带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking everybody out of there with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.02,1:03:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚好有辆车满足这个要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just the vehicle to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.53,1:03:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好乐 我进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and I'm in.
