Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.13,1:03:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 你在那儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.51,1:03:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯检查 萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comm check. Sabina.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.01,1:03:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.11,1:03:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简 - 收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.64,1:03:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃琳娜 - 收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elena. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.25,1:03:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要对着手镯说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk into your bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.75,1:03:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚错过了一个连赢位置投注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just missed a superfecta.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.12,1:03:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望第三轮有好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better luck in the third run, I hope.
