Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.69,1:03:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.43,1:03:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blue one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.87,1:03:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.37,1:04:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,离预约时间还有六分钟 有发现吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six minutes to post time. Anybody see anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.37,1:04:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.85,1:04:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 你有什么发现吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you got anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.01,1:04:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.32,1:04:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.16,1:04:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿利姆·哈桑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alim Hassan.
