Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.06,1:04:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 卡塔尔王子 - 是的 相当有钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, "Qatari prince." - Yeah, serious money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.77,1:04:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相当有钱 - 拥有上百匹马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Serious money." - Owns hundreds of horses.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.00,1:04:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拥有上百匹马 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Owns hundreds of horses"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.81,1:04:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道了 他很有钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get it. He's rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.04,1:04:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是买家吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he the buyer?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.74,1:04:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里看不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have an angle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.64,1:04:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 是弗莱明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina! Fleming.
