Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.89,1:04:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绝对是他 萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's definitely him. Sabina?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.49,1:04:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.66,1:04:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,货在他手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has the goods.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.90,1:04:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.91,1:05:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的视线范围内 波士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my sights. Boz?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.94,1:05:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ride is ready.
