Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.15,1:05:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是那个杀手 - 终于出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the assassin. - Bae showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.42,1:05:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想在我之前杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you're killing him before I kill him.
