Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.26,1:05:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 简 拿下他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the shot, Jane. Bag him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.54,1:05:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 他们上车了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - They're in the Mercedes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.27,1:05:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 交易不在这儿进行 - 我们得走了 下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no sale here. - We gotta go! Get down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.98,1:05:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.08,1:05:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.91,1:05:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.79,1:05:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车上放个追踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a tracker on that Mercedes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.89,1:05:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.10,1:06:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 驾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.37,1:06:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.34,1:06:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming in!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.11,1:06:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走开 走开 走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Move, move, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.72,1:06:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 埃琳娜 - 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Elena! - I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.86,1:06:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.60,1:06:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.36,1:07:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得儿驾 - 萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Giddyup. - Sabina!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.76,1:07:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 姐妹们 - 进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guys. - Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.07,1:07:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 踩油门吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, punch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.57,1:07:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们出发 干得漂亮 - 嚯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go! Great job! - Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.54,1:07:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么 我不知道你竟然会骑马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you… I didn't know you could jump horses.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.61,1:07:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钱越多 马越多 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More money, more horses. - Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.61,1:07:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来追踪一下这辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can somebody please track this mofo?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.05,1:07:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能开这辆车追踪他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot tail him in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.42,1:07:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.86,1:07:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正往北去准备出城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed north out of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.71,1:07:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经离开了市界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've left city limits.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.44,1:07:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿除了采石场什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing out here but a rock quarry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.34,1:08:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把数据调出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up the specs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在附近守着等你信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll circle until you signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.94,1:08:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易一定在这里进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sale will definitely go down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.34,1:08:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把东西都带上 不知道都谁在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take everything. We don't know who's in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.94,1:08:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我觉得自己穿得过于隆重了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think I'm a little overdressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.95,1:08:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.25,1:08:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.16,1:08:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么可以进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a way in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.63,1:08:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 简 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja… Jane! Jane!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.91,1:09:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.13,1:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.74,1:09:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做梦吧你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.47,1:09:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.01,1:09:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一会儿就醒了 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's gonna wake up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.19,1:09:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把所有装备都拿走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got all the dots.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.79,1:09:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你信号的时候你已经行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I signaled you, you went rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.69,1:09:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要把他扔了吗 - 是的 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should we toss him? - Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.70,1:10:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 不管弗莱明在和谁做交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. Whoever Fleming's in business with,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.47,1:10:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都是活腻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is in way over his head.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.51,1:10:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那扇门封锁 把他们困住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal that gate. Lock them in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.51,1:10:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把这里的门锁好 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then lock yourself in here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.98,1:10:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是给你准备的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.65,1:10:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是薄荷糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not mints.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.25,1:10:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗 - 不是薄荷糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - Not mints.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.75,1:10:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走了 - 锁好门 记住不是薄荷糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Lock this. Not mints.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.59,1:10:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 我知道 - 锁门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I know. - Lock it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.20,1:10:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 门已经锁好了 还有一个出口有三层楼高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the gate is locked. Only other exit is up three stories.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.27,1:10:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicely done, Elena.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.76,1:11:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.60,1:11:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗莱明先生 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Fleming. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.10,1:11:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是澳大利亚乔尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Australian Jonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.73,1:11:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是把他交给美国了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we hand him over to the Americans?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.74,1:11:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他在这出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.87,1:11:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想在我杀了他之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.64,1:11:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I kill him…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.31,1:11:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚是怎么说的来着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the thing you said?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.74,1:11:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you are…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.81,1:11:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表一位不愿透露姓名的买家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I represent a buyer who wishes to remain anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.58,1:11:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.02,1:11:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我们验下货 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's have a look. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.29,1:11:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这就是卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that's Calisto.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.82,1:11:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.09,1:11:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.03,1:11:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,货到付款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}COD.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.43,1:11:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有电汇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus wire transfer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.27,1:11:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.47,1:11:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们结束交易之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before we close the deal,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.34,1:11:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老板想要一个小示范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my employer would like a little demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.64,1:11:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确保这个设备具备你说的功能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to make sure the devices do what you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.35,1:11:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to kill somebody?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.82,1:12:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,劲爆哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.32,1:12:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 是我的老板坚持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't, but my employer insists.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.49,1:12:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 随便选一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yes. Pick anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.33,1:12:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能选我 - 额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Obviously, don't pick me. - Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.36,1:12:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西达姆 抓个人过来 - 额 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sidam, go get somebody. - Uh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.80,1:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 我 我 我把报告给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I-I-I gave you the report.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.60,1:12:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的功能都在里面 杀人不包括在交易里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all outlined in there, so that was never part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.21,1:12:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛 弗莱明先生 现在包括了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Fleming, it is now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.55,1:12:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这是一个复杂的过程 很明显 我不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's a complicated process. Obviously, I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.32,1:12:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至不知道它是怎么运行的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know how it works, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.32,1:12:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要根访问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll require root access.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.05,1:12:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或一个世界级的黑客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a world-class hacker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.12,1:12:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.49,1:12:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking? Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.66,1:12:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是计划的一部分 霍达克先生（动画非凡公主希瑞中的人物）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not part of the plan, Mr. Hodak!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.26,1:12:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.50,1:12:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士 弗莱明死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz, Fleming is down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.87,1:12:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手是乔尼·斯密斯的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The assassin works for Jonny Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.37,1:12:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.04,1:12:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要行动了 准备好撤退路线了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to engage. Ready for exfil?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.87,1:12:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 把东西拿好 赶紧离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here! Someone grab that. Get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.85,1:13:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士 他们要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz, they are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.81,1:13:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, no-go?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.35,1:13:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.35,1:13:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see her anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.56,1:13:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,门打不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't open.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.66,1:13:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.19,1:13:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼修好它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go upstairs and fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.37,1:13:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 姐妹们 有人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Guys, someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.44,1:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝你们过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.56,1:13:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.24,1:14:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在上面 - 糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up there! - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.41,1:14:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到她们 - 哦 天呐 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find them! - Oh, my God. Guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.41,1:14:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 发生什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.28,1:14:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付杀手 掩护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the assassin. Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.62,1:14:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.27,1:14:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是独立小姐啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Miss Independent.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.71,1:14:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 等我一分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Uh, just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.51,1:14:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋里有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, ocupado.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.62,1:14:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.69,1:14:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 哈 疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Gah! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.46,1:14:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚一边去 我会马伽术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away. I know Krav Maga.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.79,1:14:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪学的 商场么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you learn? Shopping mall?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One! Two! Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.03,1:15:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,马伽术冲鸭 哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krav Maga! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.97,1:15:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.44,1:15:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,澳大利亚乔尼 遇见我是你的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonny Australia, the pleasure is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.35,1:15:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.45,1:15:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 那个一键睡眠的按钮在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, where's that sleepy-neck button?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.32,1:15:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有点忙 自己搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little busy. Figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.12,1:15:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.69,1:15:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 支援我{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.23,1:15:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.21,1:15:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢啦 埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Elena.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.55,1:15:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从认识你那天起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have dreamed of this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.38,1:15:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在幻象这个时刻 不过在我的想象中你是长头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the day I met you. Except your hair was longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.02,1:15:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个发型我也喜欢 这个也挺好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I like this too. This is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.66,1:16:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想都别想 - 你想和我一起逃走吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Don't even think about it. - You want to run away with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.73,1:16:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也太饥渴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're so desperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.00,1:16:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动 埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop right… Elena!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.26,1:16:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想活着再见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to live to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.70,1:16:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.91,1:16:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,太慢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.59,1:16:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 你在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.39,1:16:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手正在逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The assassin's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.64,1:16:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.97,1:16:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,额{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.41,1:16:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 让这个东西停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, stop this thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.28,1:16:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.09,1:17:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把箱子给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the case!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.29,1:17:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.66,1:17:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.83,1:17:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坚持一下 - 埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on! - Elena!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.97,1:17:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.94,1:17:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.48,1:17:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊 埃琳娜 我需要你 我需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Elena? I need you, man! I need you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.45,1:17:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜 靠边站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina, stay to the side!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.75,1:17:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.03,1:17:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.09,1:17:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.77,1:17:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.34,1:17:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快被碾进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about to get very crush-y in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.68,1:18:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, we need you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.45,1:18:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就快拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've nearly got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.68,1:18:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.82,1:18:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.02,1:18:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.00,1:18:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.13,1:18:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}reach up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.54,1:18:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane! Jane!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.97,1:18:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 这个 在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one! This one! There!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.52,1:18:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.79,1:18:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.93,1:18:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, Sabina?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.56,1:18:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿 迟来总比不来好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.27,1:19:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.24,1:19:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 贴反了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's the wrong side.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.75,1:19:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,新队员刚把自己弄晕了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did the rookie just tranq herself?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.08,1:19:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.05,1:19:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男朋友去哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.82,1:19:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍达克 那个杀手 - 跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hodak. The assassin? - Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.22,1:19:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把卡利斯托带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took Calisto with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.09,1:19:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔尼呢 - 他也跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Jonny? - He scurried off.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.66,1:19:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个小贱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.90,1:19:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Boz?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.14,1:19:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是不要被抓到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We probably shouldn't be caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.74,1:19:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在尸体旁边吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing over a dead body.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.27,1:19:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 还穿成这样 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not dressed like this, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.30,1:20:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.77,1:20:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想摸摸她吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to touch her?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.84,1:20:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.61,1:20:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰碰她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.78,1:20:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是活的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She feels alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.42,1:20:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她吵醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You woke her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.85,1:20:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.95,1:20:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在船上吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we on a boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.83,1:20:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.55,1:20:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波士利 - 波士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bosley! - Boz?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.15,1:20:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Bosley?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.69,1:20:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.83,1:21:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士利们经常翘班吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do Bosleys usually leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.83,1:21:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这感觉不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.77,1:21:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以她是走了吗 - 我们被耍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So she's gone? - Well, we were made,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.74,1:21:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她是想去调查内鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe she wanted to do a sweep.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.10,1:21:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.34,1:21:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or she's…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.58,1:21:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 她是第一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. Boz was the first Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.88,1:21:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,被提拔为波士利的天使 她和我们一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be promoted to Bosley. She's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.08,1:21:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是第一个叛变的天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would not be the first Angel to turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.45,1:21:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事发生过 你知道过去的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happened. You know the history.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.35,1:21:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她提议从实验室把卡利斯托偷出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her idea to steal Calisto from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.76,1:21:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是弗莱明抢先一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. But Fleming beat her to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.19,1:21:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务一直是把东西抢回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been our mission the entire time to get this thing back,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.23,1:21:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它总是从我们手边上溜走 好像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it just keeps slipping us, like…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.60,1:21:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能频繁失手 是 是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're better than that. It's… It's her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.20,1:21:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱明死了 卡利斯托没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleming's dead. Calisto's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.44,1:21:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so is she.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.41,1:21:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尼说他是代替别人来交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonny said he represented somebody…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.88,1:21:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个人就是波士利呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's Boz?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.22,1:21:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我房间的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.62,1:22:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.19,1:22:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理托我向你问好 你们现在很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie sends love. You're in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.96,1:22:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点出去 - 姐妹们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of there now! - Guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.62,1:22:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.87,1:22:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 趴下 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, stay down! Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.13,1:22:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 趴下 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, stay down! Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.95,1:23:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.28,1:23:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带你离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.65,1:23:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.19,1:23:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.39,1:23:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.49,1:23:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabina.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.01,1:24:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 萨比娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Sabina.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.06,1:24:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对你很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She means a lot to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.93,1:24:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的新朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're new friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.10,1:24:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.60,1:24:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一周过得太难了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a really tough week.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.21,1:24:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再失去她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose her too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.59,1:24:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.23,1:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.33,1:24:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊 天呐 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow! - Oh, God, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.83,1:25:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.97,1:25:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哭什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.90,1:25:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not crying. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.91,1:25:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明明在哭 这是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you are. That's…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.58,1:25:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.98,1:25:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 没错 我在哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, yeah, I'm crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.75,1:25:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't think that you…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.82,1:25:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在乎我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cared about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.15,1:25:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.09,1:25:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你认为我没有任何感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you don't think I have any feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.93,1:25:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.36,1:25:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很烦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.27,1:25:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是大多时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.10,1:25:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是特别烦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.34,1:25:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的 只是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't try to be. It just sort of…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.14,1:25:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像别人那样会善于隐藏真情实感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the filter thing people have.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.71,1:25:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.31,1:25:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么做的 但是它救了你一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what this is made of, but it saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.85,1:25:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.12,1:25:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Elena?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.75,1:25:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.29,1:25:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到她 所以我打了电话找人帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find her, so I called in for some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.29,1:26:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为我被炸飞了 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because I got blown up? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.26,1:26:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also because…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.63,1:26:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说服了我 不需要每件事都靠自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you convinced me I don't have to do everything by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.04,1:26:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.94,1:26:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们你们好 你们差我一个解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Angels. You owe me an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.31,1:26:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是巴西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.78,1:26:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 我带了补给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - I brought supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.18,1:26:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己做的添加了益生菌的康普茶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homemade kombucha with probiotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.15,1:26:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the best part…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.85,1:26:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.52,1:26:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 你这个叛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. You trai…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.65,1:26:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 简{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.35,1:26:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是内鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the mole.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.89,1:26:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same reason you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.96,1:26:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来应该死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.33,1:26:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打给我之后她就打给我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She called me right after you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.23,1:26:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有草药敷布可以治淤青{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an herbal compress for the bruises.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.47,1:26:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人想要 - 好吧 那你肿着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody wants that. - Okay. Keep your bruises.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.41,1:26:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那究竟是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then who?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.48,1:26:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就当在自己家一样 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make yourself at home. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.11,1:26:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让人送了点衣服来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some clothes sent up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.85,1:26:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便挑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.89,1:27:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么正式干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, why so formal?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.86,1:27:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 这是另一个总部吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, is this another headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.93,1:27:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有简和萨比娜的消息吗 她们会来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard from Jane and Sabina? Will they come?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.53,1:27:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么好奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So inquisitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.57,1:27:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,像猫一样好奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curiosity of a cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.60,1:27:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说像雪貂一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a ferret.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.30,1:27:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个科学家啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the scientist in you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.97,1:27:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想知道我现在的处境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to understand my situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.41,1:27:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想有一位观众听你和布洛克先生讨论卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted an audience with Mr. Brok to discuss Calisto.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.41,1:27:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, soon you'll have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.12,1:27:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是卡利斯托已经被偷走了 所以我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Calisto's been stolen now, so I…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.13,1:27:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.67,1:27:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很满意 计划成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satisfying when a plan comes together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.74,1:27:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们一点隐私{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give you some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.61,1:27:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.91,1:28:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.28,1:28:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟踪了他几个星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tracking him for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.92,1:28:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他降落在伊斯坦布尔的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he landed in Istanbul,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.42,1:28:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我得在他抓住你们之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I needed to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.12,1:28:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he got to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.82,1:28:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士他们要走了 行不行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz, they are leaving. Go, no-go?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.96,1:28:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boz.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.43,1:28:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.80,1:28:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我离开了采石场 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I left the quarry, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.17,1:28:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,更抱歉的是 我来得太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}more sorry I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.17,1:28:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实不敢相信 一个波士利会背叛我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe that. A Bosley?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.31,1:28:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才很快就得出结论是我干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, you had no trouble believing it was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.11,1:28:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到啦 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You heard that? - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.28,1:28:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个澳大利亚乔尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Australian Jonny.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.41,1:28:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个逃走的家伙 - 嗯 又逃掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one that got away. - Yeah, again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.45,1:28:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我看到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time we saw him,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.12,1:28:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在里约 然后 - 你把我推下了楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we were in Rio, and then… - You pushed me off a roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.69,1:28:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得忘了这事 - 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have got to get over that. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.86,1:28:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在这么做 只是在慢慢消化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. Just processing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.56,1:28:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以最后见到他的人是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then the last person to see him was…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.83,1:28:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是波士利 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was Bosley. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.53,1:28:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尼没有去监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Jonny didn't make it to jail,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.20,1:28:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以查理怀疑波士利叛变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie suspected Bosley had gone rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.17,1:28:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果发现他在建立自己的圈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns out he's building his own network,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.43,1:28:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把服务卖给出价最高的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}selling his services to the highest bidders.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.60,1:28:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在在利用我们跟罪犯做生意吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using us to date criminals now?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.40,1:29:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 乔尼 霍达克 就是那个杀手 他们都为他效力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Jonny, Mr. Hodak, that assassin, they work for Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.41,1:29:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直看起来像个怪胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always seemed like kind of a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.91,1:29:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很古怪 很英国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaky. English.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.22,1:29:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以波士利抓了埃琳娜 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So Bosley has Elena. - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.05,1:29:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们知道地点吗 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we know where? - Of course we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.19,1:29:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分衣服里都有追踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's trackers in most of the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.99,1:29:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你公寓里有很多皮夹克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a lot of leather jackets at your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.69,1:29:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到没 我跟你说了是借的 不能拿 - 嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, I told you it was borrow and not take. - Shh shh…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.83,1:29:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克正在他家的豪宅开派对 埃琳娜在他那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brok is hosting a party at his compound. Elena's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.23,1:29:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年他都要召集富人和美女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every year, he brings together the wealthy and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.00,1:29:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加他的年度“幻想派对”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his annual Vision Party.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.67,1:29:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年他正打算向投资者展示卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year, he's planning to present Calisto to investors.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.84,1:29:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么波士利要带埃琳娜去布洛克那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Bosley want to take Elena to Brok?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.11,1:29:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是把鸟人带回阿尔卡特拉斯岛上（俗称恶魔岛，曾是军事监狱）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing the Birdman back to Alcatraz, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.78,1:29:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The who?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.42,1:29:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是部电影 伯特·兰卡斯特演的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a movie. Burt Lancaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.42,1:29:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟人 迈克尔·基顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birdman. Michael Keaton.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.46,1:29:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 迈克尔·基顿是蝙蝠侠 - 不对 本·阿弗莱克是蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Michael Keaton is Batman. - No, Ben Affleck is Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.56,1:29:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他像吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.53,1:29:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这里唯一认识伯特·兰卡斯特的人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only person here who knows who Burt Lancaster is?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.40,1:30:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得了脑震荡 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm concussed. - Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.93,1:30:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是部老片子 是… - 你多大岁数了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's an old movie. It's from… - How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.27,1:30:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多大 什么 这个无关紧要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old am I? What? That has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.77,1:30:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没看过你的推荐信 - 有各种年龄段的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have your references. - There are film buffs…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.24,1:30:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电影爱好者 - 我们还是去接我们的女孩吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of all ages. - Let's go get our girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.52,1:30:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.73,1:30:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你翻了你妈妈的衣橱才找到这个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you raid your mom's closet for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.54,1:30:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还跟你玩过别的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else of hers do you play with?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.38,1:30:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生的工作都在评估女性的才能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent an entire career estimating the talents of women.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.12,1:30:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, my dear,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.29,1:30:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聪明得令人赞叹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are marvelously clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.83,1:31:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.26,1:31:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.16,1:31:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再为汤森德事务所工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I no longer work for the Townsend Agency.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.17,1:31:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我退休了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was retired.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.20,1:31:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来给我演示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are going to show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.34,1:31:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么破解这个东西 重新编辑根访问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to hack this and reprogram root access…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.94,1:31:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把权限给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.55,1:31:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为弗莱明可以做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought Fleming could do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.85,1:31:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是有一个习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always had a habit of claiming credit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.88,1:31:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢不属于他的功劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he didn't deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.55,1:31:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要多久 - 做梦 我不会碰它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long will it take? - Forever. I'm not touching it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.36,1:31:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 你以为你有选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha, you think you have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.03,1:31:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.69,1:31:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会 她们会来问候你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll send… They'll send love.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.53,1:31:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会问候你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll send love.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.34,1:31:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺顽强啊 看来你一直在学习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, feisty. You've been studying.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.51,1:31:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望她们来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.66,1:32:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这栋别墅有四层 大约60个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The compound has nearly 60 rooms on four levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.86,1:32:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有36名保安负责这个派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's 36 security guards contracted for the party,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.83,1:32:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有布洛克的私人保镖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus Brok's private crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.38,1:32:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我喜欢的歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my song!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.38,1:33:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想喝吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did you want one?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.82,1:33:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 好吧 我们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm good. - Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.96,1:33:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜被困在顶层 西北角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena's being held on the top floor, northwest corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.96,1:33:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,救她是首要任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's our priority.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.26,1:33:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 这层楼不对外开放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oop! Hey. - This is a private floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.69,1:33:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就转了个身 这个地方太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just turned around. This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.96,1:33:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找洗手间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.63,1:33:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的想要去嘘嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I really need to pee.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.77,1:33:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走错了吗 我想也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I in the wrong place? I thought may…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.14,1:34:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.44,1:34:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.71,1:34:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.28,1:34:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄地 用不暴露自己的方式消灭敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To neutralize an enemy discreetly and anonymously.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.02,1:34:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我工作中的黄金原则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a gold standard in my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.45,1:34:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这是缺点 我却认为是天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you deem a flaw, I deem a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.45,1:34:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个天赋不仅提供权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that not only provides power…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.72,1:34:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且授予权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but confers it as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.13,1:34:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在我的办公室干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, what are you doing in my office?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.10,1:34:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克先生 天呐 感谢老天 请帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brok? Oh, my God. Thank God. Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.67,1:34:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在这干什么 - 这些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is she doing here? - These men…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.27,1:34:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我有点不懂 我以为你都搞定她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, I'm a little confused. I thought you handled her.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.61,1:34:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handled me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.45,1:34:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.68,1:34:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想阻挠我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to sabotage me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.02,1:34:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在期待什么 花吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you expecting, flowers?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.29,1:34:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是手写的感谢信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handwritten thank-you note?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.52,1:34:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她除掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of her already.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.06,1:34:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我觉得她对我们还是有用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I believe that she can still prove useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.56,1:35:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道他是谁吗 - 知道啊 我的全球安全主管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you even know who he is? - Yes. My global security chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.40,1:35:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰刚刚从皮特·弗莱明那里拿回了卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John's just recovered Calisto from Peter Fleming,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.47,1:35:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个目光短浅又贪婪的叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that shortsighted, greedy traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.41,1:35:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了他 他们杀了弗莱明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed him. They killed Fleming.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.88,1:35:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不听 我不听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, la-la-la-la-la!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.68,1:35:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的问题 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the problem with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.51,1:35:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直跟我说我不能知道的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep telling me shit I can't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.42,1:35:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,合理的借口 你听说过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plausible deniability. You ever heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.52,1:35:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个糟糕的员工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible employee.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.92,1:35:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 谁在乎有人死了 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and who cares if people die, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.92,1:35:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要投资人开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the investors are happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.63,1:35:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,成熟一点 小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow up, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.96,1:35:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利斯托将改变世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto is about to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.36,1:35:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想烤蛋糕 你就得打破几个鸡蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to bake a cake, you got to break a few eggs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.13,1:35:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是煎蛋卷 如果你想把死人比作鸡蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's omelet. If you're gonna compare dead people to eggs,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.97,1:35:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能起码把词用对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you at least use the correct phrase?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.30,1:35:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该在这里 你是安全隐患{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't be here, ha, ha. You're a security threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.77,1:35:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责处理她 你起的头 你来收尾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of her and finish what you started.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.31,1:35:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.88,1:35:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 我还要开派对呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excuse me. I have a party to host.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.15,1:35:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让一让 - 请坐 布洛克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo, Tats, move. - Take a seat, Mr. Brok.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.09,1:35:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.82,1:36:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what the hell's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.63,1:36:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.10,1:36:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.27,1:36:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, you work for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.14,1:36:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我是你们所有人的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all of you work for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.24,1:36:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个笨蛋 哈哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dumbass. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.61,1:36:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.31,1:36:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.11,1:36:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把卡利斯托从你这偷走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stealing Calisto from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.58,1:36:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要把它当作武器 暗杀别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna use it as a weapon. To assassinate people.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.11,1:36:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴滴滴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beep, bop, bloop.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.34,1:36:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴滴哒 滴滴滴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloop, beep, bloop, boop, boop!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.58,1:36:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该行了 - 我也这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That ought to do it. - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.45,1:37:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你授予根权限 布洛克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you would grant root access, please, Mr. Brok.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.35,1:37:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh, you're crazy. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.79,1:37:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会给你权限的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving you my access.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.02,1:37:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会改变区块链{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could alter the blockchain.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.83,1:37:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会毁了它 你真的会毁了一切的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could ruin it. You could literally ruin everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.80,1:37:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 嗷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.30,1:37:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的计划是推出卡利斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our intention is for Calisto to be released.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.33,1:37:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它上市 就跟计划好的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the market as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.54,1:37:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 让我黑进去的单元越多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, the more units there are out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.17,1:37:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to hack into, the better.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.31,1:37:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给他 他们把所有知道这件事的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it. They've killed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.04,1:37:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,都杀了 只剩下你和我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows about this except you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.55,1:37:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克先生是两起杀人案的同谋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brok is complicit in the deaths of two people.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.98,1:37:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 现在我很乐意把这事告诉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh… - Now, I am very happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.25,1:37:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在执法部门的老同事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to inform my former colleagues in law enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.23,1:37:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 亚历山大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Alexander.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.90,1:37:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,已获得根权限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root access granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.70,1:37:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我所做的就是赢 赢 赢 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ All I do is win, win, win. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.07,1:37:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不管怎样我脑子里想着钱 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No matter what Got money on my mind. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.87,1:37:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我永远无法摆脱它 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I can never get it off. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.50,1:37:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不接吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.54,1:37:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.88,1:37:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我所做的就是赢 赢 赢 不管怎样 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ All I do is win, win, win No matter what. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.04,1:38:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.58,1:38:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在我的脑海里，我永远无法摆脱 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ …on my mind I can never get it off. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.68,1:38:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了 这是在警告有人试图打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. It's an attempted access alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.02,1:38:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的私人保险柜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my personal safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.92,1:38:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 轮到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.12,1:38:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.26,1:38:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看我能不能让你改变心意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me see if I can change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.87,1:38:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我再给你一个愉快的惊喜 你就会听话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if I gave you another delightful surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.51,1:38:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰斯顿 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langston. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.94,1:38:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直被锁在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been in there all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.41,1:38:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把人藏在我路易十四的柜子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid a person in my Louis XIV?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.88,1:38:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有毛病吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.12,1:38:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有幽默感 这是你的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sense of humor, that's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.03,1:39:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才在想是你就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping it would be you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.84,1:39:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贱人 - 友情提醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bitch. - Fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.01,1:39:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次见面之后 我交了个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since we last met, I made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.82,1:39:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 情况怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, what's the update?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.62,1:39:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快搞定他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! We're almost done with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.99,1:39:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.23,1:39:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,转换根权限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching root access.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.53,1:40:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字和大拇指指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name and thumbprint.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.87,1:40:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.34,1:40:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好约翰 根权限已授权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, John. Root access granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.81,1:40:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 好姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Done. - Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.41,1:40:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我得确认下它是不是真的好用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to check, of course, that it's actually working.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.51,1:40:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利斯托 启动短程能量爆发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calisto, short-range power burst.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.35,1:40:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 命令不能改写 - 啊 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No override. - Ah, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.89,1:40:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么啊 会害死我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? It will kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.19,1:40:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 只会杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be daft. It will kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.16,1:40:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及那个不知道名字的家伙 我们不会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's-his-name. Not us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.56,1:40:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下楼享受你的派对 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be downstairs enjoying your party. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.16,1:40:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我下楼 假装一切都好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to go down there and pretend everything's fine?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.80,1:40:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is fine.
