Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.82,1:40:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 兰斯顿 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Langston. Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.35,1:40:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.02,1:40:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙是个十足的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy is a total dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.57,1:41:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿到了吗 - 当然了 姐妹 有我罩你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get it? - Yeah, girl, I got you.
