Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.71,1:41:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好好玩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.58,1:41:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.68,1:41:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 借过 抱歉 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. Sorry! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.06,1:41:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的派对 亚历克斯 享受吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your party, Alex. Enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.63,1:41:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界不太平 亚历克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is on fire, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.33,1:41:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我肯定你这一代人会找到办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure your generation is gonna figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.60,1:41:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人吗 救救我们 - 这里肯定有钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, help us! - There must be a key somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.84,1:41:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的导师埃德加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, it was my mentor, Edgar,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.11,1:41:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,教会了我在搏击中怎么获胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who taught me how to win a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.28,1:41:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你之前战胜了我两次吗 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you beat me twice before? No.
