Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.11,1:42:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,七招{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven moves…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.01,1:42:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,和脆弱的自尊心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a fragile ego.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.29,1:43:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this happening?!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.80,1:43:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到她了 - 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got her. - Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.34,1:43:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 萨比娜 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! Oh, ho, ho! - Sabina! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.41,1:43:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来找我了 - 这一身太好看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came for me. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.88,1:43:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个东西怎么闪个不停 - 那个啊 没什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is that thing doing that? - Oh, that? That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.58,1:43:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚编辑了程序 就是让它闪一闪 响一响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just programmed it to light up and make noises.
