Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.14,1:44:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是波士利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bosley,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.27,1:44:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要揍扁你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.98,1:44:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在工作了40年之后会安静地离开吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to go quietly after 40 years?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.62,1:44:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的职业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.10,1:44:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你寡不敌众 天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're outmanned, Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.64,1:44:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.78,1:44:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.28,1:44:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使向你问好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the love.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.18,1:45:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,英格丽德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ingrid?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.50,1:45:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你一直挺忙的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.00,1:45:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.74,1:45:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在商言商 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just business, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.01,1:45:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在和我合作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.31,1:45:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.25,1:45:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建立了这家事务所 让它逐渐发展壮大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I built this agency from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.08,1:45:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理死了 公司应该是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be mine after Charlie died.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.42,1:45:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我被挤出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was pushed out.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.72,1:46:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望我会做什么 从事园艺吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect me to do? Take up gardening?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.46,1:46:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是你造就了我们 是我们造就了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you made us. We made you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.00,1:46:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 我们一直信任你 你个混蛋 - 晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we trusted you, you dick. - Good nigh…
