Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.84,1:46:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理干净 天使们 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweep it clean, Angels. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.85,1:46:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去加州训练成为一名天使吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to go to California and train to be an Angel?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.92,1:46:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I…
