Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.84,1:46:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你挺聪明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.00,1:46:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的优点吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that your thing?
