Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.61,1:46:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定了怎么处理埃琳娜·霍夫林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I decided what to do with Elena Houghlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.21,1:46:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么做 - 她现在是我们的新队员了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - She's our new recruit.
