Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.01,1:46:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢你 波士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Thank you, Boz.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.52,1:46:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the call.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.05,1:46:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the call.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.22,1:47:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在加利福尼亚都训练什么 - 跳过飞机没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you do in California? - Ever jumped out of a plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.42,1:47:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不太做高空运动 - 哦 呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't really do heights. - Oh, um…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.93,1:47:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和鲨鱼一起游过泳吗 - 嗨 是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you swam with sharks? - Hey! It's you.
