Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.60,1:47:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和鲨鱼一起吗 不太长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharks? Not long.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.60,1:47:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hey. - Hi.
