Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.91,1:47:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,磷是我最喜欢的化学物质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my favorite chemical.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.64,1:47:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为你当时 - 没错 混合了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because you were… - Exactly, mixed with…
