Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.28,1:47:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们干的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.72,1:47:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.99,1:47:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他终于“戳”到点子上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he, uh, finally got the point.
