Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.16,1:47:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说笑话给这个帅呆子听吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doing, like, a joke thing for the handsome nerd?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.83,1:47:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 挺好笑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course not. - I mean, it's working,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.17,1:47:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是在说笑话的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that is what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.54,1:47:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想联系你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I'm trying to get in touch with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.70,1:47:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么做才好 - 别担心 我会找到你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how would I do that? - Oh, don't worry. I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.38,1:48:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did that?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.45,1:48:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.45,1:48:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜·霍夫林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena Houghlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.06,1:48:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯丽·加勒特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly Garrett.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.72,1:48:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到汤森德事务所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Townsend Agency.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.74,1:48:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拐最后一个弯的时候你松油门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lifted coming into the last corner.
