Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.79,1:48:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举起来 不要怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up. No fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.06,1:48:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,与疼痛作斗争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight through the pain.
