Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.31,1:49:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Done! - …blow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.72,1:49:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你没有死 霍夫林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job not dying, Houghlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.69,1:49:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余人 清理干净 重新来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you, clean up and start again.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.03,1:49:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍夫林 起来 我们走 离跳伞还有10秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houghlin, get up! Let's go! Ten seconds to jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.53,1:49:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有人都起来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody up! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.50,1:49:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不怕 我们冲啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not freaking terrified at all! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.37,1:49:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天在上 今天请多多关照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven above, watch over us today.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.34,1:49:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我成为真的天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me a literal angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.11,1:49:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一辈子都在为这个时刻做训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been training for this moment my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.78,1:49:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位新成员 终极挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, recruits! One final challenge!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.58,1:49:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,露丝·巴德·金斯堡（美国联邦最高法院大法官）99年跳下去的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Ruth Bader Ginsburg made this jump in '99…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.42,1:49:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是天使吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}RBG is an Angel?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.32,1:49:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都没听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget I said that!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.12,1:49:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.76,1:49:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为天使吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be the love!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.13,1:49:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳吧 克洛伊 跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Chloe, go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.60,1:50:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.17,1:50:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.64,1:50:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要降落这架飞机 霍夫林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to land this bird, Houghlin.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.67,1:50:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望在地面上见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I see you on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.58,1:50:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.61,1:50:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.16,1:50:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.36,1:50:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 好了好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.29,1:50:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.69,1:50:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.36,1:50:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想死她了 - 太好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I've missed her! - Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.93,1:50:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 宝贝 降落下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, baby! Bring her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.84,1:50:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好样的 好样的 - 耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, yes, yes! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.34,1:50:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔吼 - 好样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Woo-hoo! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.54,1:50:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.71,1:50:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的是她啊 - 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There she is! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.01,1:50:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 你做到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job. You did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.08,1:50:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们能来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.42,1:50:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做到了 - 我降落了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course you did. - I landed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.79,1:50:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一点都不担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we weren't worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.09,1:50:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点吧 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A little worried. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.29,1:50:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我闻闻你的嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me smell your breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.99,1:51:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她竟然没吐 - 噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She didn't even puke! - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.66,1:51:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.26,1:51:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.95,1:52:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在椅子上签名 正式一点 什么都别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Sign the chair, make it official. Don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.72,1:52:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来来来 来一小杯 干了 干了 干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, here we go. Shots, shots, shots!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.63,1:52:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你熬过了训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it through training.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.33,1:52:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm so nervous, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.36,1:52:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.60,1:52:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 酒 我需要酒 - 它能减轻疼痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shots. I need it. - That'll help.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.30,1:52:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.27,1:52:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voilà.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.47,1:52:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 坐好了 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready? Ass in the chair, lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.31,1:52:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始吧 - 好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.61,1:52:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我想纹在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Guys, I think I want mine there.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.61,1:52:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好地方吗 我觉得这里不会太疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a good place? I don't think that hurts as much.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.31,1:52:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 如果疼痛等级是从1到10{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's very sweet. - Okay, on a scale of one to 10,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.88,1:52:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个到底有多疼 说实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much does it hurt? Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.48,1:52:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 - 我已经感觉不出疼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me. - I no longer feel pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.25,1:52:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比中弹轻 比穿孔疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than a bullet, more than a piercing.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.25,1:52:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 完全没有参考价值 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I have no reference for that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.59,1:52:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 天使们 - 早上好 查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Angels. - Good morning, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.23,1:52:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.09,1:52:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.50,1:52:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了我随时可以开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm ready if you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.97,1:52:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 给我翅膀吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah. Give me my wings.
